WEBVTT

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:54.805
I don't know
about you, it's too hot today, isn't it?

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:59.143
And it's going to get even worse.
Temperatures up in the mid-30s Celsius...

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:03.063
...that's the mid-90s Fahrenheit,
tomorrow, maybe even hitting 100.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.900
So, please, remember to cover up
and stay cool...

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.903
...with the hottest hits on your FM dial.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.822
Come on, guys, time to go home.

00:01:12.573 --> 00:01:14.700
Come on, love, off you get.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:20.080
- Do we have to?
- Yes, we do.

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:23.626
I'll make you your favorite dinner
to compensate.

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:26.670
He squealed like a pig, didn't he?

00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:30.341
Yeah, brilliant punch, Big D.
Did you see his face?

00:01:30.508 --> 00:01:31.753
Hey, Big D.

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:34.779
Beat up another 10-year-old?

00:01:35.005 --> 00:01:37.688
- This one deserved it.
- Yeah.

00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.499
- Five against one, very brave.
- Well, you're one to talk.

00:01:42.896 --> 00:01:46.900
Moaning in your sleep every night?
At least I'm not afraid of my pillow.

00:01:50.236 --> 00:01:53.072
"Don't kill Cedric."

00:01:53.615 --> 00:01:55.241
Who's Cedric, your boyfriend?

00:01:56.576 --> 00:01:59.460
- Shut up.
- "He's going to kill me, Mum."

00:02:00.827 --> 00:02:02.189
Where is your mum?

00:02:04.053 --> 00:02:05.731
Where is your mum, Potter?

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:08.058
She dead?

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.278
Is she dead?

00:02:12.145 --> 00:02:13.560
Is she a dead Pott--?

00:02:14.177 --> 00:02:15.637
Whoa.

00:02:28.024 --> 00:02:29.818
- Dudley.
- Dudley, let's go.

00:02:32.278 --> 00:02:34.114
-What's going on?
-What are you doing?

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.792
- I'm not doing anything.
- We're getting out of here, Dudley.

00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:38.952
Come on, Dudley, hurry up.

00:03:29.294 --> 00:03:31.254
Dudley, run.

00:04:06.915 --> 00:04:08.291
Expecto Patronum.

00:04:38.154 --> 00:04:39.948
Mrs. Figg.

00:04:43.827 --> 00:04:45.912
Don't put away your wand, Harry.

00:04:46.204 --> 00:04:48.581
They might come back.

00:04:49.874 --> 00:04:52.836
Dementors in Little Whinging,
whatever next?

00:04:53.002 --> 00:04:56.965
-Whole world's gone topsy-turvy.
-I don't understand. How do you know--?

00:04:57.132 --> 00:04:59.342
Dumbledore asked me
to keep an eye on you.

00:04:59.509 --> 00:05:01.594
Dumbledore asked you?
You know Dumbledore?

00:05:01.761 --> 00:05:02.887
Uh-huh.

00:05:03.054 --> 00:05:06.891
After You-Know-Who
killed that poor Diggory boy last year...

00:05:07.058 --> 00:05:09.727
...did you expect him to let you
go wandering on your own?

00:05:09.894 --> 00:05:12.564
Good Lord, boy.
They told me you were intelligent.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:15.349
Now, get inside and stay there.

00:05:15.609 --> 00:05:17.236
Expect someone will be in touch soon.

00:05:17.403 --> 00:05:20.281
Whatever happens, don't leave the house.

00:05:29.707 --> 00:05:32.084
It is hot. That's right, hot everywhere.

00:05:32.251 --> 00:05:33.898
There's sweat. There's stifling.

00:05:34.545 --> 00:05:36.464
Diddykins?

00:05:36.797 --> 00:05:38.189
Is that you?

00:05:42.011 --> 00:05:44.299
Duddy. Vernon, come quick.

00:05:46.371 --> 00:05:47.770
We're going to have to
take him to a hospital.

00:05:48.867 --> 00:05:50.644
Who did this to you, boy?

00:05:55.065 --> 00:05:57.985
Happy, are we, now? Eh?

00:05:58.152 --> 00:06:00.821
You've finally done it.
You've finally driven him loopy.

00:06:00.988 --> 00:06:03.824
Vernon, don't say that.

00:06:03.991 --> 00:06:08.329
Well, just look at him, Petunia.
Our boy has gone yumpy.

00:06:09.042 --> 00:06:10.664
I've reached my limit, do you hear?

00:06:11.441 --> 00:06:14.668
This is the last I'm gonna take
of you and your nonsense.

00:06:28.599 --> 00:06:30.684
- Dear Mr. Potter.
- What?

00:06:31.351 --> 00:06:36.106
The Ministry has received intelligence
that at 6:23 this evening...

00:06:36.273 --> 00:06:41.028
...you performed the Patronus Charm
in the presence of a Muggle.

00:06:41.237 --> 00:06:43.280
As a clear violation...

00:06:43.447 --> 00:06:47.535
...of the Decree for the Reasonable
Restriction of Underage Sorcery...

00:06:47.701 --> 00:06:50.209
...you are hereby expelled...

00:06:50.926 --> 00:06:53.707
...from Hogwarts School
of Witchcraft and Wizardry.

00:06:55.146 --> 00:06:57.808
Hoping you are well, Mafalda Hopkirk.

00:07:03.517 --> 00:07:04.982
Justice.

00:07:17.565 --> 00:07:19.733
He's not very well.

00:07:32.968 --> 00:07:34.081
Sorry, Hedwig.

